5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We must verify crew capacity before committing to any plan. I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to repeat past mistakes. I will check the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme to see what actually finished.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I need to understand the hidden approval chains. I will review the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the long-term costs. I will look into the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know where minutes actually go! I will check the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, completion records are useful, but they do not tell us who is left to do the next job.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, you are right. But if the last plan failed, the crew is useless. I need to know what actually broke.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the drawings rarely show the real bottleneck. I am checking the committee minutes to see who else must sign off.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. Hidden approvals often delay things. I am just trying to see if the fees will keep rising.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, fees are boring! I am curious if the stopwatch proves the crowd is actually stuck or just loud.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, crowd counts show demand, not capacity. I need to know if the late-turn rosters are already empty before we promise more.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, loud is a symptom. I need the autopsy. If the last plan stalled, the new one will too.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, capacity is one layer. I am tracing the approval signatures to find the invisible gates that stop work before it starts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I understand the noise. But I am worried the fees will eat the budget before the work even starts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, but if the stopwatch says the platform is empty, why do people complain? I want to find the real bottleneck!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, the stopwatch measures flow, not the hands that keep it moving. I will also check the crew establishment and maintenance contract.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the hands matter, but the scars matter more. I will also check the two pilots from eight years ago to see what they actually delivered.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the hands matter, but the signatures stop them. I will also check the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, the hands matter, but the fees bind them. I will also check the balances in the capital ledger to see what is truly left.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I will also check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city! I want to see if the stopwatch matches the grumbling.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
