35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The late-turn pool is hollow. Overtime covers everything. The lift contract has spare capacity, though.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The accessibility programme finished four lifts on time, but the lane priorities failed. The pilots worked. I will not repeat the lane mistake.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The committee minutes reveal a data deadlock between ferry and rail. Roadway consents are delegated, though.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The fees exceed the paving budget. The ledger has a lapsed grant balance, but the operating subsidy was trimmed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The stopwatch says platforms clear fast, but the trips are slower! The minutes vanish in the waiting gaps, not the crowds.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, the lane failure confirms your caution. But the hollow late-turn pool means any plan needing overnight works is already overcommitted.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the hollow pool is a trap. I will not sign off on anything needing overnight shifts. The pilots proved we can deliver without them.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the data deadlock is the real trap. Any plan touching ferry or rail integration will stall in committee. Roadway is clear.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, that deadlock is frightening. I am glad the roadway is clear. I just need to know if the lapsed grant can cover the rising fees.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, if the ferry and rail are stuck, we must fix the waiting gaps! The stopwatch proves the connections are the real thief, not the platforms.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, the waiting gaps are real, but fixing them requires crews. The late-turn pool is empty. We cannot promise what we cannot staff.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, the gaps are real, but the pilots proved we can fix them without overnight crews. I refuse to risk the hollow pool again.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, the gaps are real, but the pre-war shells hide voids. Bidders price heavy contingency now. That is where the schedule dies.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, the gaps hurt, but the fees are rising. I worry the lapsed grant will vanish before we fix them.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, if the grant is gone, we must fix the gaps with what we have! The stopwatch says the waiting is the enemy, not the money.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, the lapsed grant is a ghost. The real constraint is the hollow late-turn pool. We must pick a plan that fits the spare lift capacity, not the empty rosters.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, the lift capacity is the only safe harbor. I will not gamble on the empty rosters. The pilots proved daytime works succeed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the lift capacity is safe, but the pre-war shells are a minefield. I will not risk a plan that digs into those voids.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I hear you. The rosters are empty, but the fees are rising. I am afraid the lapsed grant will not cover the ticketing costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, the stopwatch says the waiting is the thief! We must fix the gaps, not just the lifts. I am ready to see the plans!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
